# Verification + Codex (`/v+codex`)

When the user invokes **`/v+codex`**:

1. Complete Phase 1 per [`.cursor/commands/vcodex.md`](../commands/vcodex.md) and [`ex-react-verify-codex` skill](../skills/ex-react-verify-codex/SKILL.md).
2. Run Codex read-only review **only** when all applicable SC-xx/DP-xx items pass.
3. Codex never modifies code — Cursor may fix issues in a follow-up turn.

Skip Codex silently only when the user explicitly opts out or Codex CLI is not configured (document that in the report).
